          "text": "Wakenza tshilulu tshia buanda bua bleu ne bukunzubile ne bukunze-kunzû ne bua lin, bakenza tshifuanyikishi tshia bakeluba mu tshilulu kudi bantu bakadi ne lungenyi lule. ",
