          "text": "Wakenza tshilulu tshikuabo tshia buanda bua bleu ne bukunzubile ne bukunze-kunzû ne bua lin tshia kuteka ku mbelu kua tshitendelelu, wakatshienzesha kudi bena lungenyi lule, ",
